# Generated web scan-index artifacts (large, reproducible, CDN-hosted — see
# frontend/public/scan-index/README.md). The iOS ScanIndex assets are TRACKED
# in git deliberately: Xcode Cloud builds from a fresh clone, so gitignored
# assets would ship a scanner with no model/index. See
# docs/scanner-asset-packaging.md.
frontend/public/scan-index/*.json
frontend/public/scan-index/*.bin

# Generated offline catalog packs (READMEs remain tracked).
data/catalog/
frontend/public/catalog/*
